# A key during dictation cancels it and gives Alt and the key. AC-9.
0 in sock connect
0 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
400 in key KEY_A down
350 out sock start 0
400 out sock cancel 400
400 out key KEY_LEFTALT down
400 out key KEY_A down
450 in key KEY_A up
450 out key KEY_A up
500 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
500 out key KEY_LEFTALT up
